designs.companions:
Denim steel #84a0c4 is the needle. It is used for the tuning-scale pointer under the current place, the current tab, Settings entry and menu item, hovered rows (2px left edge), the hovered picker option, today on the month (inset needle and outlined numeral, not amber), the family's chat boxes (2px edge), the spaced-caps head links, the locate icon, and the accent on Home, Vera, Status and Settings.

Slate is the family's material:
- band #10161a under every section;
- zebra #161d22 on alternate rows;
- raised act boxes #151b1e (filters, forms, add/save folds, pickers);
- hover and the family's bubble #1f272e;
- lines #2d353b and #3a454c for the band rules and dotted leaders.

Blue-grey #a4b0c2 is the machine's labels and facts column, and cream #ebe6da the titles and heads. Sage #86d9a6 is for lit things: the typing frame, checkboxes, done, ticks. Amber keeps one job, 'needs a look': the setup band's 2px rule and head, late due times, the Needs a look tag. Section colours appear only on the band-head icons and the kind designator tints (14% for cool kinds, 5% for warm). The cobalt wash #4f60e6 at 2.4 lights the greeting's top right, opposite the green pool.

briefs.hypothesis:
REFINEMENT of the strongest carried palette, Signal Galley (r8-idea-1: 7.87, in all seven lenses' top fours). It keeps the winner's idea whole: the green-black slate trays, one strip with a tabular facts column, the fortnight line with one breathing #6dff9c now lamp, the timetable margins, the lamp legend, the masthead and the targets.

It applies every concrete fix the judges wrote for it, plus the grafts five lenses asked for in their notes. From Reverse Video, the palette it tied with, it takes:
- heads set into the rail;
- a quiet reverse video for 'this one';
- square family surfaces against round machine glass;
- Send on the From row;
- the full-width Ideas search;
- a compact Status.

It also brings in steel-cyan (the feedback lens asked for it in place of the periwinkle) and the thinner case that no entrant has yet built.

The two leaders each lost points the other did not, so a child that keeps both strengths and neither set of faults should beat both. It also carries the consensus breed that has won rounds 6, 7 and 8. As a refinement it stays close to Signal Galley on purpose, but four things change the look of every page:
- steel-cyan in place of periwinkle;
- reverse-video 'here';
- heads set into the rails;
- the thin, square case.

